Wendy: Danilo... thank goodness. What happened to you?
Danilo: [shake]Wen... I found everything Mateo left behind.[/shake]
Danilo: [shake]I saw... everything that happened to him.[/shake]
Danilo: [color=#808080](Danilo shows her the diary)[/color]
Wendy: I don’t see anything written here, Danilo...
Danilo: [shake]Look closely, Wen.[/shake]
Danilo: It’s all here. His anger. His fear.
Danilo: All the crying he did while he was trapped. 
Danilo: I don’t know why only I can read this... but it’s real.
